    "description": "<div class=\"powr-chat\" id=\"fa409859_1652894558\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium; color: #808080;\">Decorative, kraft boxes custom-made to hold an 8oz diffuser bottle, with a special slot for 10-12 reed sticks. <br /><br />$2 each or save by purchasing a full case and pay only $1.70 each plus free shipping in the continental U.S. $7 flat rate shipping applies to all orders under $75. <br /><br />Box measures 3-1/8\" wide by 12-3/16\" tall by 2-5/8\" deep we use a squared 8oz bottle and recommend that you purchase a sample box to test with your glassware before purchasing a full case. There is a notch that folds in to hold the jar in place on the back side of the box and two notches that fold in to hold the reed sticks. The second and third photo show these details.<br /><br />** THIS PRODUCT CANNOT BE RETURNED **&nbsp;</span></p>",
